# ORIGINA Laravel

Read `AGENTS.md` before implementation. It is the repository-level authority.

Current phase is frontend-first. Do not add database, authentication, API, commerce, payment, admin persistence or external-integration behaviour unless the owner explicitly expands scope.

For every migrated page, inspect the matching `PHENOMVALENCE/origina-next` route and shared components first. Mirror its UI, UX, copy, responsive behaviour and approved assets unless a deviation is explicitly approved.

Use Blade components, semantic HTML, CSS design tokens, progressive enhancement and WCAG 2.2 AA practices. Keep changes in small Conventional Commits.

Git history belongs to the human maintainer. Never add agent/AI/bot authorship, co-author trailers or implementation credits.

When architecture, security, scope or the design system changes, update the relevant `docs/` file in the same change.
